 "headline": "“UNIVERSAL PICTURES and IHC KNOW HOW TO THROW A PARTY!” - Attendee",
 "intro": "NOBODY 2 MADE A SPLASH AT HURRICANE HARBOR WITH A PRIVATE PRESS &amp; VIP PARTY TAKEOVER!",
 "introPieces": [
  {
   "type": "introGallery",
   "media": [
    {
     "type": "image",
     "src": "/images/69fb9d64419837f056d3a5f0_nobody2_index.JPG",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "src": "/images/69fba2a65e4dcffa28128b21_IHCXNOBODY2_2025_0731_230827-7375_DB-p-2000.avif",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "src": "/images/6a05145f330563ff964ce853_IHCXNOBODY2_2025_0731_210501-6461_DB-p-2000.jpeg",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "src": "/images/69fba2a5fb13821574aaddf4_IHCXNOBODY2_2025_0731_220441-6910_DB-p-2000.avif",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "src": "/images/69fba4caffcb416f870f7fb5_IHCXNOBODY2_2025_0731_230056-7327_DB-p-2000.avif",
     "alt": ""
    }
   ],
   "html": "<p>To promote  the release of <em>Nobody 2</em>, we took over Six Flag’s Hurricane Harbor for an experience that blended high-octane stunts, star power, and vacation energy to host the party of the summer!</p>\n<p>Our exclusive after-hours takeover provided immersive branded photo opportunities, curated music, and unlimited complimentary food and drinks. Bob Odenkirk did surprise stunt moments with press onsite, adding another layer of surprise &amp; delight for guests. The result was a can’t-miss experience with unlimited sharing potential.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "GUEST ARRIVAL & DECOR",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Throughout the park, every corner delivered an immersive takeover, featuring action-packed Easter eggs and a reimagined General Store window showcasing costumes from the film alongside themed décor.</p>"
    },
    {
     "type": "gallery",
     "media": [
      {
