     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "PHOTO MOMENTS",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Throughout the park, guests were invited to capture moments at multiple themed photo opportunities. VIP guests posed for photos with our onsite Getty photographer featuring the film’s title treatment and action-themed props. A massive Nobody 2 title, anchored by an in-theaters banner, rose from the wave pool, creating a larger-than-life hero photo moment. </p>",
     "right": "<p>The Lightning Falls slide offered an adrenaline-filled shot, capturing riders mid-splash against a backdrop of cinematic explosions. Other photo moments included posing by the seahorse and sandcastle sculpture with a wooden branded sign, as well as recreating the movie’s key art on Skull Island.</p>"
    },
    {
     "type": "gallery",
     "media": [
