  },
  {
   "title": "PARTY VIBES",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Shekdash and BlaketheMan1000 kept the energy buzzing all night, filling the park with nonstop beats that had guests dancing between rides and poolside moments. Whether floating down the lazy river, relaxing in the private VIP chill zone, or chasing thrills on the water rides, guests soaked in the full party atmosphere. Throughout the night, every bar and food stall stayed open, serving unlimited themed cocktails, sweet treats, and savory bites to keep the celebration going strong.</p>"
    },
    {
     "type": "gallery",
     "media": [
