  {
   "title": "CREATORS & CONTENT",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Hurricane Harbor became a content powerhouse, with every element crafted to capture and amplify shareable moments. A QR-enabled wristband and signage system allowed guests to instantly access and share their photos, creating a seamless content ecosystem.</p>",
     "right": "<p>As Bob Odenkirk conducted on-camera interviews with top press outlets, stunt actors brought the mayhem to life by performing choreographed stunts and breaking into surprise fights throughout the park. These high-energy moments perfectly captured the chaotic vibe of the movie.</p>"
    },
    {
